    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThe Final Penthouse Awaits at Lansdowne Place!\n\nExperience unparalleled luxury in this stunning three-bedroom plus study penthouse at 18 The Harvey. \n\nApartment Type PB2 offers an expansive total area of 4,771 sq. ft./534 sq. m., ensuring ample space for comfortable living and entertaining.\n\nThe unit itself spans 3,280 sq. ft./305 sq. m. and features three generously sized bedrooms. The master bedroom includes its own ensuite marble bathroom and a walk-in wardrobe, while the other two bedrooms each have their own ensuite. Additionally, there is a convenient powder room for guests.\n\nA dedicated study room provides the perfect space for work or quiet reflection. The large, open-plan kitchen and dining room is ideal for both everyday living and entertaining, seamlessly connecting to a spacious living room.\n\nComplementing the luxurious interior is an impressive roof terrace, covering 1,491 sq. ft./229 sq. m. This outdoor space has spectacular and unparallelled views of the sea and Dublin city and is perfect for relaxation and entertaining, offering a private retreat with ample room for various activities.\n\nThe development has been designed by award-winning architects O'Mahony Pike in collaboration with London-based interior architects Goddard Littlefair, to deliver the elegant interiors for the residential amenities. \n\nResidents at Lansdowne Place and their guests will enjoy the benefit of a full 24/7 Concierge Service, The Morning Lounge, The Reading Room, The Pembroke Business Suite, The Clyde Function Room as well as a fully air-conditioned Cinema Room with an Adobe surround sound system. This lifestyle initiative, never seen before in Ireland, also houses a fully equipped gym, a sauna, steam room and multipurpose treatment rooms.\n\nEach apartment at Lansdowne Place is bright and spacious with large open plan living spaces and generous ceiling heights, up to 2.7 m (8' 10”), along with floor to ceiling windows throughout. A selection of penthouses will enjoy double height ceilings in the living space. The apartments and penthouses released offer a variety of accommodation including:\n\nFor further information, please contact: David Rhatigan, Sherry FitzGerald Tel: +353 87 667 9018 or Email: david.rhatigan@sherryfitz.ie\n\nhttp://www.lansdowneplace.ie/"
      },
